meta {
  name: 73 Lab Test Field Permissions
  seq: 73
}

docs {
  # Lab Test Field Permissions ("Lab Test Master Setting")

  Business Settings › **Lab Test Master Setting** — a tenant-wide Allow/Deny
  map for every field on the Lab Test Master Data experience (Basic Details,
  Pricing, TAT, Flags, Sample, Results, Reference Range, Reference Value,
  Version Control). Single source of truth consumed by three surfaces on the
  Lab Test Master Data page (`/business-admin/lab-config/master-data`):

  - The **Customize Fields** sidebar — a Denied field never appears in the
    Field Name list.
  - The **listing table's columns** — a Denied field's column is hidden.
  - The **Add/Edit Test form** — a Denied field is not rendered.

  Single row per tenant (`lab_test_field_permission_settings`, unique on
  `tenant_id`), stored as `config: { [section]: { [field]: boolean } }`. Every
  field defaults to **Allowed** (`true`) — a tenant only stores the fields it
  has denied; anything omitted (including a brand-new field added to a future
  release) resolves to Allowed.

  - **GET `/business-admin/lab-test-field-permissions`** — open read (any
    authenticated business user); always returns the complete map (defaults
    merged with any saved overrides).
  - **PUT `/business-admin/lab-test-field-permissions`** — merges the given
    `config` into the tenant's stored overrides. Requires
    `business_admin:lab_test_master_setting__update_lab_test_master_setting`;
    audited under `AuditModule.LAB_TEST_FIELD_PERMISSIONS`.

  Select the **Local** environment before running any request.
}
